notes.body:
Something like this works, but I'm not certain it's as necessary because the lookup is only on creation (and there's the edge case mentioned above, I guess). But I'm fine with adding it if you prefer.

```c
    static dissector_handle_t base_tls_handle = NULL; 
    if (base_tls_handle == NULL) {
        base_tls_handle = find_dissector("tls");
    }
    if (tls_handle == base_tls_handle) {
```

